---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us - Football Central"
  description="Learn about Football Central - Your trusted source for football analysis, rankings, and expert commentary on the beautiful game."
>
  <Header />
  
  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-700 text-white py-16">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6">About Football Central</h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Your trusted source for football analysis, rankings, and expert commentary on the beautiful game.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Our Mission</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
              At Football Central, we believe football deserves thoughtful analysis, not just hot takes. 
              We're dedicated to providing evergreen insights that help fans understand the beautiful game at a deeper level.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              Our content focuses on tactical breakdowns, player analysis, historical perspectives, 
              and informed opinions that stand the test of time.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">What We Cover</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-600 mr-3">📊</span>
                <span><strong>Analysis:</strong> In-depth tactical and statistical breakdowns</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-yellow-600 mr-3">🏆</span>
                <span><strong>Rankings:</strong> Data-driven player and team comparisons</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-purple-600 mr-3">💭</span>
                <span><strong>Opinion:</strong> Thoughtful commentary on football's biggest debates</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-red-600 mr-3">⚽</span>
                <span><strong>Features:</strong> Player profiles and club histories</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Our Approach</h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎯</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Quality Over Quantity</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                We focus on creating well-researched, evergreen content rather than chasing daily news cycles.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📚</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Evidence-Based</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                Our analysis is grounded in data, statistics, and careful observation of the game.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🌍</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Global Perspective</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                We cover football from around the world, celebrating the sport's universal appeal.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Why Football Central?</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700">
            <p>
              In an era of clickbait headlines and reactive content, Football Central stands apart. 
              We believe football fans deserve better than sensationalized stories and knee-jerk reactions.
            </p>
            
            <p>
              Our team of passionate football enthusiasts brings years of experience watching, 
              analyzing, and writing about the sport. We combine deep knowledge of the game 
              with clear, accessible writing that both casual fans and tactical enthusiasts can enjoy.
            </p>
            
            <p>
              Whether you're looking to understand why a particular formation works, 
              comparing players across different eras, or exploring the tactical evolution of the game, 
              Football Central provides the context and analysis you need.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-8 mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Our Values</h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">🔍 Accuracy</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                We fact-check our content and cite reliable sources to ensure accuracy.
              </p>
              
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">⚖️ Fairness</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                We strive for balanced coverage and acknowledge different perspectives on controversial topics.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">🎓 Education</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                We aim to help readers learn more about football and develop a deeper appreciation for the game.
              </p>
              
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">🤝 Respect</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                We respect all clubs, players, and fans while maintaining our editorial independence.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Join Our Community</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8 text-lg">
            Football Central is more than just a blog—it's a community of fans who love the beautiful game. 
            Join us for thoughtful discussions, expert analysis, and a deeper understanding of football.
          </p>
          
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <a 
              href="/blog" 
              class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition"
            >
              Read Our Latest Articles
            </a>
            <a 
              href="/contact" 
              class="border border-blue-600 text-blue-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-50 transition"
            >
              Get In Touch
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  
  <Footer />
</Layout>